{"synopsis":"Di dunia tempat artefak mitologi menjadi sumber kekuatan dan kekayaan, ia berhasil menaklukkan segalanya hingga dinobatkan sebagai Raja Artefak. Namun, kemenangan itu ternyata hanyalah awal. Saat umat manusia di-reset dan Perang Majesty dimulai, semua yang pernah menjadi miliknya dirampas. Kini, ia kembali bukan untuk mengikuti aturan dunia, melainkan menciptakan hukumnya sendiri—merampas kembali setiap artefak, menghancurkan para pencuri, dan menjarah harta dari seluruh dunia.","alternative_title":"도굴왕: 엔드라인","author":"SAN.G, Yuns","artist":"Redice Studio, 3B2S","chapters":[{"number":"21","chapter":"21","slug":"3f299984-cb1f-460a-93e2-5ff030447da0","title":"Chapter 21","date":"2026-08-13"},{"number":"20","chapter":"20","slug":"38c1a280-a82f-4db1-ad78-36a2ca8aacc6","title":"Chapter 20","date":"2026-08-07"},{"number":"19","chapter":"19","slug":"d3251489-fc89-4058-9ad3-9eb49e68589c","title":"Chapter 19","date":"2026-07-31"},{"number":"18","chapter":"18","slug":"7f3c1fa0-6576-4d3e-9a6b-2bc1415514d6","title":"Chapter 18","date":"2026-07-24"},{"number":"17","chapter":"17","slug":"e63611db-4c34-4578-8adf-29fca3a266c5","title":"Chapter 17","date":"2026-07-17"},{"number":"16","chapter":"16","slug":"144112b2-7ff3-4d20-a3ac-d2319cb817bd","title":"Chapter 16","date":"2026-07-09"},{"number":"15","chapter":"15","slug":"54697f6a-88dd-4223-8353-2bf5a0f70ed9","title":"Chapter 15","date":"2026-07-05"},{"number":"14","chapter":"14","slug":"43227db8-40b1-4df8-8b14-6c326376b5ca","title":"Chapter 14","date":"2026-07-05"},{"number":"13","chapter":"13","slug":"24a9eefe-e2eb-43c2-8185-010dd87af287","title":"Chapter 13","date":"2026-07-05"},{"number":"12","chapter":"12","slug":"bcb9ee75-ecfa-4da8-b2e5-7eb58d98da89","title":"Chapter 12","date":"2026-07-05"},{"number":"11","chapter":"11","slug":"820de847-58ab-42cc-808d-c79b9b9b7584","title":"Chapter 11","date":"2026-07-05"},{"number":"10","chapter":"10","slug":"d56be9d6-2de1-4a3d-b321-1e66e2770bf2","title":"Chapter 10","date":"20